@ship yuzu_arrives_at_school:
    @confess "A new school. A new uniform. Same old me."
    @confess "I didn't expect the student council president to be so cold."
    @confess "I didn't expect her to be my stepsister either."
    @promise "nothing will ever be the same"

@ship mei_on_the_rooftop:
    @confess "You talk too much."
    @confess "You don't understand what this school means."
    @confess "You don't understand what anything means."
    @promise "Silence..."

@ship the_kiss:
    @confess "She didn't ask."
    @confess "I didn't stop her."
    @confess "It lasted only a second but I felt it for days."
    @confess "Was it punishment? Was it something else?"
    @promise "I still don't know.."

@ship yuzu_alone_after:
    @confess "My heart was pounding so loud I thought she could hear it."
    @confess "She walked away like nothing happened."
    @confess "Like I was nothing."
    @confess "So why couldn't I stop thinking about her?"
    @promise "Falling without knowing it..."

@ship mei_alone_after:
    @confess "I don't know why I did that."
    @confess "I don't know what I was trying to prove."
    @confess "She looked at me like I was the whole world."
    @confess "Nobody has ever looked at me like that."
    @promise "A crack in the wall.."
